      x: '<p><b class="rd">might / may / could have + V3</b> — o‘tmishda <b>ehtimol</b> bo‘lgan: «She <b>might have missed</b> the bus.» (balki ulgurmagan)</p><p><b class="rd">could have + V3</b> yana boshqa ma’no ham beradi: <b>imkoniyat bor edi, lekin foydalanmadi</b>: «You <b>could have called</b> me!» (qo‘ng‘iroq qilishing mumkin edi — qilmading)</p><p><b>might not have</b> — balki qilmagan: «He <b>might not have heard</b> the news.»</p>',
