  A: [{
    k: 'Hikoya', t: 'A Very Busy Saturday in Town', s: 'Zarina bir kunda hamma xizmatlarni qanday aylanib chiqdi',
    p: [
      ['Zarina had a busy Saturday ahead. First she took her blue suit to the [dry cleaner], because she wanted it clean for an interview. On the way she saw a [launderette], a [barber], a [florist] and an [optician], all [around the corner|around the corner]. At the [repair shop] she left her broken phone. The man asked for a [quote], and the [estimate] seemed [reasonable]. “It’ll be done [in no time|in no time],” he said, “we offer [prompt] service.”',
       'Zarinaning band shanbasi bor edi. Avval u zangori kostyumini kimyoviy tozalashga olib bordi, chunki intervyuga tozasi kerak edi. Yo‘lda u kir yuvish xonasi, sartarosh, gul do‘koni va optikni ko‘rdi, hammasi yaqin joyda edi. Ta’mirxonada u singan telefonini qoldirdi. Usta narx taklifini so‘radi, taxminiy narx maqbul tuyuldi. «Tez orada tayyor bo‘ladi, — dedi u, — biz tezkor xizmat ko‘rsatamiz.»'],
      ['Next, she went to the [town hall] to [renew] her ID card. The [receptionist] at [reception] was [courteous] and explained that a document was [overdue]. “Your fee is [conveniently|convenient] small,” she joked. Zarina had to [iron out|iron out] the missing paper. Then she visited the [tailor] to [alter] a dress, because it was too long. The [tailor] promised to finish it “[at your service|at your service]” the next day.',
       'Keyin u ID kartasini yangilash uchun shahar hokimiyatiga bordi. Qabulxonadagi xodim xushmuomala edi va bitta hujjatning muddati o‘tganini tushuntirdi. «Sizning to‘lovingiz qulay darajada kichik», deb hazil qildi u. Zarina yo‘qolgan qog‘ozni hal qilishi kerak edi. Keyin u ko‘ylakni o‘zgartirish uchun tikuvchiga bordi, chunki u juda uzun edi. Tikuvchi uni ertasi kuni «xizmatingizga tayyor» deb tugatishni va’da qildi.'],
      ['At home she found a [parcel] in front of the door. A [courier] had left it, but the box was [damaged] and the lamp inside was [faulty]. She called [customer service] to [complain]. “[The customer is always right|The customer is always right],” the operator said, “we will [dispatch] a new one.” The [service charge] for delivery was added to her bill, but the company would [deliver|deliver] a new lamp for free. Zarina smiled: finally somebody understood.',
       'Uyda u eshik oldida posilkani topdi. Kuryer uni qoldirgan edi, lekin quti shikastlangan va ichidagi chiroq nosoz edi. U shikoyat qilish uchun mijozlarga xizmatga qo‘ng‘iroq qildi. «Mijoz doim haq, — dedi operator, — biz yangisini jo‘natamiz.» Yetkazib berish uchun xizmat haqi hisobiga qo‘shildi, lekin kompaniya yangi chiroqni bepul yetkazib beradi. Zarina jilmaydi: nihoyat kimdir tushundi.'],
      ['In the evening her brother asked, “Why don’t you just do it yourself? [Do-it-yourself|Do-it-yourself] is cheaper.” Zarina laughed. “I’d rather spend the money on [maintenance|maintenance] and [overhaul] my phone. I like to [service|service] things regularly.” At the locksmith’s she had a new key made, and at the [locksmith] she had a spare. “Today everything has been sorted,” she said happily. The [promptly|promptly] answered calls had made her day.',
       'Kechqurun akasi so‘radi: «Nega hammasini o‘zing qilmaysan? O‘zi qilish arzonroq.» Zarina kuldi. «Men pulni texnik xizmatga sarflab, telefonimni yangilashni afzal ko‘raman. Narsalarga muntazam xizmat ko‘rsatishni yoqtiraman.» Qulf ustasida u yangi kalit yasatdi va zaxira ham olib qo‘ydi. «Bugun hammasi hal bo‘ldi», dedi u xursand bo‘lib. Tezda javob berilgan qo‘ng‘iroqlar uning kunini yaxshi qildi.']
    ],
    q: [
      ['Why did Zarina take her suit to the dry cleaner?', ['She needed it for an interview.', 'It was dirty.', 'It was old.'], 0],
      ['Why did she go to the town hall?', ['To renew her ID card', 'To pay a fine', 'To meet the mayor'], 0],
      ['What was wrong with the parcel?', ['It was damaged and the lamp was faulty.', 'It was late.', 'It was empty.'], 0],
      ['What did customer service promise?', ['A new lamp for free', 'A refund only', 'Nothing'], 0],
      ['What did her brother suggest?', ['Do-it-yourself', 'Buy a new one', 'Sell the lamp'], 0]
    ]
  }],
